Error [jet.ViewOutlivesOwner]: Returned view escapes its declared `from` clause
  --> tests/ui/view_from_escape.jet:1:41
    |
  1 | bad: fn(packet: [Int], other: [Int]) -> View<Int> from packet { other[0..1] }
    |                                         ^^^^^^^^^
 Why: Every return path's owners must stay inside the sources named after `from`
 Fix: Widen the `from` clause, or stop returning a view from that owner
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E2305
